  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a sacred feathered serpent. Coatl eidolon can resemble all manner of coatl, though a majestic skybound serpent covered in radiant plumage is the most common. A bond with a coatl comes most often when a coatl has already chosen to guide and defend the settlement the summoner resides.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> Divine</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> beast, coatl, eidolon, holy</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> the Universe</p><hr /><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> coil (bludgeoning), wings (bludgeoning), jaws (piercing)</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> <em>Con</em> +1, <em>Int</em> +0, <em>Wis</em> +1, <em>Cha</em> +1</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Diplomacy, Religion</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> one common language</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 15 feet; fly 20 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Initial (1st) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.fB08hAHytVnyLBjl]{Skybound Serpent}</strong></p><p><strong>Symbiosis (7th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.4SUCZ5dvsW698TR2]{Radiant Wings}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><p><strong>Transcendence (17th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.UJfG1kp0kAf7GcR1]{Serpent Hope}</strong></p><hr /><p>The summoner's half of this eidolon is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.summons-unleashed.Item.sKq4pveHHxE1gTAd]{Coatl Eidolon} in the Summons Unleashed compendium.</p>"
